sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 1 is executed after the <Configured transaction duration> is reached

    Note over CS,CSMS: 1. Execute Reusable State EVDisconnected
    Note over CS,CSMS: The TransactionEventRequest containing eventType Ended contains the MeterValue field<br>- timestamp: the intervals between the timestamps of the received Meter Value messages equal the configured value at configured clock-aligned Tx ended Meter Values interval<br>- sampledValue.context is Sample.Clock AND the last one has Transaction.End<br>- sampledValue.signedMeterValue is <Generated SignedMeterValueType>

    Note over CS,CSMS: This causes the transaction to stop
